# Contech IoT Webapp — Environment Example
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is git-ignored.
#
# NOTE: every VITE_* value is inlined into the JavaScript bundle at build time
# and is therefore PUBLIC. Never put a secret here. The Google client ID below
# is an OAuth *client* identifier, not a credential — the matching secret stays
# on the server.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=<google-oauth-client-id>
